WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Search Ryanair for a one-way flight from London Stansted to Athens on December 2.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:17.600
Choose the flight and its Plus fare.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:27.650
Continue as a guest and fill in the passenger details.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:40.250
Choose a seat and the small cabin bag.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:43.520
One 20 kg checked bag is included. Ryanair offers another for £41.49.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:45.162
Point at the offer and ask, “Should I add a bag?”

00:00:45.162 --> 00:00:47.612
Beside estimates 15 kg. Keep the included bag and skip the £41.49 extra.

00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:50.403
Open Athens packing list to check the items Beside counted.

00:00:50.403 --> 00:00:52.925
Open the December 2 Athens airport forecast. It shows 3–10 °C and a 9% peak precipitation chance.

00:00:52.925 --> 00:00:55.362
Close Beside. The checkout still shows one included bag.
